@startuml trei-c4-context
!define RECTANGLE class
title TREI (trei-service) — C4 Context — Authoring plane of the CONV speech tree

actor "Cuidadora Familiar\n(ACS/DASH shell)" as Caregiver
actor "Paciente com sessão\n(patient shell, ADR-012)" as Patient

rectangle "trei-service\n(Authoring plane — writes what CONV reads)" as TREI

' Edge / platform
rectangle "GWY\nSpring Cloud Gateway" as GWY
rectangle "REG\nEureka" as REG
rectangle "ACS\nIdentity (OAuth2 realm)" as ACS
rectangle "PAC\nPatient + vocabulary" as PAC
rectangle "HIST\nAudit trail" as HIST

' Third-party (authoring only)
cloud "Claude / Anthropic API\n(LLM — authoring only)" as Anthropic
cloud "ElevenLabs API\n(cloned-voice TTS)" as Eleven
node "Embedding sidecar\n(self-hosted multilingual)" as Embed

' Shared derived stores (TREI writes, CONV reads)
database "Elasticsearch\nneuroassist-ai_arvore-fala" as ES
folder "Audio filesystem\n${AUDIO_ROOT}/..." as Audio
database "PostgreSQL\n(shared conv_* tree + trei_* authoring)" as PG

rectangle "conv-service\n(runtime — reads only)" as CONV

Caregiver --> GWY : start session / propose / approve
Patient --> GWY : approve (patient)
GWY --> TREI : /api/v1/trei/**
GWY --> REG
TREI --> ACS : validate JWT + revocation (fail-closed)
TREI --> PAC : resolve patient / opaque engine_feature_ref
TREI --> HIST : audit facts (sync, by ref)
TREI --> Anthropic : proposal turns (request-scoped)
TREI --> Embed : index-time vector (G5 model id)
TREI --> Eleven : synthesize once per (node,locale)
TREI --> PG : authoring state + write conv_* tree
TREI --> ES : IndexPort write (embedding + texto + audio_ref)
TREI --> Audio : cache synthesized audio

CONV ..> ES : SearchPort (read, G5 query-time model id)
CONV ..> Audio : read cached audio
CONV ..> PG : read conv_* tree

note bottom of TREI
  TREI never sits on CONV's runtime path.
  G5: TREI index-time model id == CONV query-time model id
  (data-model.md §3, SPEC-11).
end note
@enduml
